common-passwords.txt is derived from SecLists (https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists):

  Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-1000000.txt
  commit 97e8798de8031310faa8093e3c72391f784707e7
  SHA-256 424a3e03a17df0a2bc2b3ca749d81b04e79d59cb7aeec8876a5a3f308d0caf51

Only the entries from 12 characters to 72 bytes in UTF-8 are kept, lowercased, without duplicates
and sorted. scripts/common-passwords.mjs regenerates it.

